  "summary": "<p>Marco Rubio, Secretary of State</p>\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-default-hero-container wp-block-default-hero-container--no-featured-content \">\n\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-default-hero module featured-content page-header \">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"row bc_row\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-content__copy\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"featured-content__headline stars-above\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tLiberia National Day\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-meta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- get document type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta doctype-meta\">Press Statement</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__audience\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__location\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__publish-date\">July 26, 2026</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"page-header__actions\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"classic-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-classic\">\n<p>On behalf of the United States of America, I extend congratulations to the people of Liberia on your country&#8217;s 179th year of independence.</p>\n<p>On this occasion, we proudly reaffirm our continued partnership and friendship with the Government and people of Liberia. I look forward to continuing our close collaboration on priorities that will strengthen our bilateral relationship and enhance the security and prosperity of both our nations.</p>\n<p><input type=\"hidden\" data-filter=\"111001000111\" /></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>",
